    <programlisting>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>I2C<sp/>{#DRIVERS_I2C_PAGE}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>I2C<sp/>driver<sp/>provides<sp/>API<sp/>to<sp/>configure<sp/>the<sp/>I2C<sp/>module.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Below<sp/>are<sp/>the<sp/>high<sp/>level<sp/>features<sp/>supported<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>I2C<sp/>driver.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Features<sp/>Supported</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Each<sp/>I2C<sp/>has<sp/>2<sp/>selectable<sp/>mode<sp/>i.e.<sp/>Controller<sp/>and<sp/>Target<sp/>with<sp/>bit<sp/>rate<sp/>upto<sp/>400Kbps</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Support<sp/>for<sp/>Clock<sp/>duty<sp/>cyle<sp/>of<sp/>33%<sp/>and<sp/>55%<sp/>over<sp/>Transmitter<sp/>and<sp/>Receiver<sp/>Mode<sp/>with<sp/>bit<sp/>count<sp/>upto<sp/>8<sp/>bit<sp/>per<sp/>byte</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>FIFO<sp/>Mode,<sp/>Loopback<sp/>mode,<sp/>Repeat<sp/>Mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Support<sp/>for<sp/>7-bit<sp/>and<sp/>10-bit<sp/>addressing<sp/>mode<sp/>and<sp/>16<sp/>FIFO<sp/>level<sp/>interrupt</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Support<sp/>for<sp/>Manual<sp/>and<sp/>Automatic<sp/>Extended<sp/>Clock<sp/>Stretching<sp/>via<sp/>hardware<sp/>and<sp/>software<sp/>interrupts<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>SysConfig<sp/>Features</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">@VAR_SYSCFG_USAGE_NOTE</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Selecting<sp/>I2C<sp/>Device<sp/>mode<sp/>-<sp/>Controller<sp/>Mode<sp/>or<sp/>Target<sp/>Mode.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Selecting<sp/>I2C<sp/>Clock<sp/>duty<sp/>cycle<sp/>-<sp/>33%<sp/>or<sp/>55%<sp/>duty<sp/>cycle.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Specifying<sp/>initial<sp/>mode,<sp/>bit<sp/>count,<sp/>data<sp/>count,<sp/>emulation<sp/>mode,<sp/>target<sp/>and<sp/>own<sp/>addresses<sp/>fo<sp/>each<sp/>I2C<sp/>SOC.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Enabling<sp/>and<sp/>configuring<sp/>I2C<sp/>FIFO<sp/>and<sp/>non-FIFO<sp/>interrupts<sp/>and<sp/>registering<sp/>interrupt<sp/>handlers.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Configuring<sp/>I2C<sp/>GPIO<sp/>Pinmux<sp/>and<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>Levelfor<sp/>each<sp/>I2C<sp/>SOC.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Features<sp/>NOT<sp/>Supported</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>High-Speed<sp/>Mode<sp/>(HS-Mode)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>CBUS-Compatibility<sp/>mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Important<sp/>Usage<sp/>Guidelines</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>I2C<sp/>has<sp/>both<sp/>SDA<sp/>and<sp/>SCL<sp/>pin<sp/>qualification<sp/>set<sp/>as<sp/>Open-drain<sp/>output<sp/>with<sp/>pull-up<sp/>enabled<sp/>and<sp/>no<sp/>synchronization.<sp/>A<sp/>pull-up<sp/>register<sp/>is<sp/>required<sp/>for<sp/>both<sp/>SDA<sp/>and<sp/>SCL<sp/>channel<sp/>for<sp/>proper<sp/>functioning<sp/>of<sp/>I2C<sp/>module.<sp/>Push-Pull<sp/>and<sp/>Inverted<sp/>pin<sp/>type<sp/>is<sp/>invalid<sp/>for<sp/>I2C<sp/>module.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Example<sp/>Usage</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Include<sp/>the<sp/>below<sp/>file<sp/>to<sp/>access<sp/>the<sp/>APIs</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;i2c.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
